WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.350
Have you ever wondered about the innermost
desire of the happiest SCP around, SCP-999

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.620
or "The Tickle Monster?"

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:13.280
The Foundation used SCP-978, or The Desire
Camera, to snap a photo of SCP-999 while it

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.760
was enjoying a bowl of M&amp;Ms, and this was
the result:

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.150
"Enveloping the photographer, who is laughing
hysterically."

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:26.080
It would seem that SCP-999 wants nothing more
than to do what it does every day: bring joy

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.099
to those around it, tickle people, and make
them laugh.

